Our pricing model aligns with the client's global budget of €900,000 over 5 years, with a target gross margin percentage between 25% and 35%. We propose a tiered pricing model and flexible payment plans to ensure that our costs are aligned with the client's budgetary capacity while delivering the expected quality of service.

